The previous review targeted head `000c967c4278`, which was superseded by a rebase onto latest `main` before the reviewer could fetch it — its "cannot verify" note is a fetch race, not a code finding. The current head `2eaf2168a56` is pushed, exact-head CI is green (run 31647395066), and the runtime screenshots (Portals page active/empty, app-through-portal with live reload, unauthorized 401) are in the PR description above.

All prior findings remain addressed on this head: per-target cookie jars, listener-namespaced auth cookies, and write-scoped redaction of the token-bearing `url`/`tokenQuery` on `portal.list` and the `portal.changed` broadcast (`portal.open` returns them as a distinct required-field result). Independent autoreview is clean on `2eaf2168a56`.

